=\"c37\"><span class=\"c15 c3\">Prerequisites:</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c112\" colspan=\"2\">\n            <p class=\"c37\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">None</span>\n            </p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c55\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c15 c3\">Co-requisites:</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c77\" colspan=\"4\">\n            <p class=\"c37\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">None</span>\n            </p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"c24\">\n        <td class=\"c127\" colspan=\"3\">\n            <p class=\"c37\">\n                <span class=\"c15 c3\">Designated Innovation Journey Course: </span>\n            </p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c10\" colspan=\"8\">\n            <p class=\"c37\">\n                <span class=\"c2\"></span>\n            </p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n<p class=\"c37 c27\"><span class=\"c2\"></span></p>\n\n<!-- Required Books/Readings and Suggested References -->\n<h1 class=\"c135\"><span class=\"c28 c11 c13\">Required Books/Readings:</span></h1>\n<p class=\"c36 c67 c27\"><span class=\"c2\"></span></p>\n<ul class=\"c31 lst-kix_list_4-0 start\">\n    <li class=\"c37 c67 c119 li-bullet-0\">\n        <span class=\"c2\">Fundamentals of Database Systems (ISBN: 9780306406157&lt;br/&gt;Logic and Computer Design Fundamentals (ISBN: 9780306406658</span>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n\n<div>\n    <p class=\"c37 c67\">\n        <h1 class=\"c28 c71 c45 c13\">Suggested References/Readings:</h1>\n    </p>\n    <ul class=\"c31 lst-kix_list_2-0 start\">\n        <li class=\"c53 c119 c67 li-bullet-0\">\n      <span class=\"c2\">Fundamentals of Database Systems (ISBN: 9780306406157)&lt;br/&gt;Logic and Computer Design Fundamentals (ISBN: 9780306406658)</span>\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Official Course Description and Learning Outcomes -->\n<h1 class=\"c53\">\n    <span class=\"c28 c11 c13\">Official Course Description:</span>\n</h1>\n<p class=\"c121\">\n      <span class=\"c2\">The course will teach students to think about information systems using an adversarial mindset, evaluate risk to information systems, and introduce controls that can be implemented to reduce risk.</span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"c121 c27\"><span class=\"c2\"></span></p>\n<h1 class=\"c102\">\n    <span class=\"c28 c11 c13\">Course Learning Outcomes:</span>\n</h1>\n<p class=\"c139\">\n    <span class=\"c2\">At the end of this course, a student will be able to:</span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"c36\"></div>\n<p class=\"c27 c36\"><span class=\"c2\"></span></p>\n<h1 class=\"c102\">\n    <span class=\"c114\">Innovation Outcomes (if applicable):</span>\n</h1>\n<p class=\"c37 c60 c27\"><span class=\"c2\"></span></p>\n<table class=\"c128\">\n    <tr class=\"c24\">\n        <td class=\"c21 c59\">\n            <p class=\"c37 c60\"><span class=\"c2\">Innovation Outcome</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c59 c118\">\n            <p class=\"c37 c60\"><span class=\"c2\">Associated CLO</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c39\">\n            <p class=\"c37 c60\"><span class=\"c2\">Assessment Method</span></p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"c24\">\n        <td class=\"c21\">\n            <p class=\"c37 c60\"><span class=\"c2\">(CLO from innovation course material)</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c118\">\n            <p class=\"c37 c60\"><span class=\"c2\">(Associated CLO from list above)</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c52\">\n            <p class=\"c37 c60\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">(Map to assessments)</span>\n            </p>\n            <p class=\"c37 c60\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">Needs to be specific. For example, it could be a particular section of a report</span>\n            </p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n<p class=\"c37 c27\"><span class=\"c2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"c37\" id=\"h.gjdgxs\">\n    <span class=\"c11\">Mapping of CLOs to PLOs:</span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"c37\" id=\"h.7ogsur5kbn0l\">\n      <span class=\"c13 c78\">\n        Please refer to the table below to see the mapping of the Course Learning Outcomes to the Program Learning Outcomes:&nbsp;&#8203;\n      </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"c37 c27\"><span class=\"c2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"c37\">\n    <span class=\"c11\">CLOs-PLOs Mapping Table</span>\n</p>\n<table class=\"c20\">\n    <tr class=\"c24\">\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; width: 40px; text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\"></td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; font-weight: 700;\">\n            <span class=\"c15 c3\">CSEC 140: Introduction to Cybersecurity</span>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\">a</td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\">b</td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\">c</td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\">d</td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\">e</td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center; font-weight: 700;\">f</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"c24\">\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; width: 40px; text-align: center;\">1</td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px;\">\n            <span class=\"c2\">\n                <span>No CLOs available for this course yet.</span>\n            </span>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center;\"></td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center;\"></td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center;\"></td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center;\"></td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center;\"></td>\n        <td style=\"border:1px solid #000; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: center;\"></td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n<p class=\"c37 c27\"><span class=\"c2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"c37\">\n    <span class=\"c11\">Program Learning Outcomes:</span>\n</p>\n<div>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"width: 52px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0 8px 4px 20px;\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">a)</span>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 0 0 4px 0;\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">Analyze a complex computing problem and to apply principles of computing and other relevant disciplines to identify solutions.</span>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"width: 52px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0 8px 4px 20px;\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">b)</span>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 0 0 4px 0;\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">Design, implement, and evaluate a computing-based solution to meet a given set of computing requirements in the context of the program’s disciplines.</span>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"width: 52px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0 8px 4px 20px;\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">c)</span>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 0 0 4px 0;\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">Communicate effectively in a variety of professional contexts.</span>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"width: 52px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0 8px 4px 20px;\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">d)</span>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 0 0 4px 0;\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">Recognize professional responsibilities and make informed judgments in computing practice based on legal and ethical principles.</span>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"width: 52px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0 8px 4px 20px;\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">e)</span>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 0 0 4px 0;\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">Function effectively as a member or leader of a team engaged in activities appropriate to the program’s discipline.</span>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"width: 52px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0 8px 4px 20px;\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">f)</span>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"vertical-align: top; padding: 0 0 4px 0;\">\n                <span class=\"c2\">Identify and analyze user needs and to take them into account in the selection, creation, integration, evaluation, and administration of computing-based systems.</span>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"c37 c27\"><span class=\"c2\"></span></p>\n\n<!-- Teaching & Learning Methodologies -->\n<p class=\"c60 c97\">\n    <span class=\"c28 c11 c13\">Teaching &amp; Learning Methodologies:</span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"c102 c75 c110\">\n      <span class=\"c2\">In Person</span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"c102 c75 c110\">\n      <span class=\"c2\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"c102 c75 c110\">\n    <span class=\"c3\"></span>\n    <span class=\"c13\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"c102 c75 c110\">\n    <span class=\"c3\"></span>\n    <span class=\"c13\">\n\n      </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"c37\">\n    <br>\n    <span class=\"c114\">Grading Scheme (please edit as per the course)</span>\n    <br>\n</p>\n\n<!-- Grading Scheme Table (static in this example) -->\n<table class=\"c20\">\n    <tr class=\"c24\">\n        <td class=\"c18\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c87 c3\">Excellent</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c89\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c87 c3\">Good</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c18\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c3 c87\">Satisfactory</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c18\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c87 c3\">Minimal Pass</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c89\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c87 c3\">Fail</span></p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"c24\">\n        <td class=\"c18 c103\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c5\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c89\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c5\">B+ 87-89.99</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c18\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c5\">C+ 77-79.99</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c18\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c5\">D &nbsp; 60-69.99</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c89\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c5\">F &nbsp; 0-59.99</span></p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"c24\">\n        <td class=\"c18\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c5\">A &nbsp; 94-100</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c89\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c5\">B &nbsp; 83-86.99</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c18\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c5\">C &nbsp; 73-76.99</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c18 c103\">\n            <p class=\"c37 c27\"><span class=\"c5\"></span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c89 c103\">\n            <p class=\"c37 c27\"><span class=\"c5\"></span></p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr class=\"c24\">\n        <td class=\"c18\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c5\">A- &nbsp;90-93.99</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c89\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c5\">B- &nbsp;80-82.99</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c18\">\n            <p class=\"c37\"><span class=\"c5\">C- &nbsp;70-72.99</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c18 c103\">\n            <p class=\"c37 c27\"><span class=\"c5\"></span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"c89 c103\">\n            <p class=\"c37 c27\"><span class=\"c5\"></span></p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<!-- Coursework and Distribution (with a loop for assessments) -->\n<h1 class=\"c97 c60 c140\">\n    <span class=\"c114\">Coursework and Distribution </span>\n    <span class=\"c50\">(please edit as per the course)</span>\n    <span class=\"c28 c11 c13\">:</span>\n</h1>\n<p class=\"c37 c86 c60\">\n      <span class=\"c2\"></span>\n</p>\n<table class=\"c134\">\n    <tr class=\"c82\">\n        <td class=\"c99\">\n            <p class=\"c27 c33\"><span class=\"c2\"></span></p>\n            <table class=\"c107\">\n                <tr class=\"c109\">\n                    <td class=\"c57 c59\">\n                        <p class=\"c53 c60 c122\"><span class=\"c15 c3\">Assessment</span></p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td class=\"c47 c59\">\n                        <p class=\"c14\"><span class=\"c15 c3\">CLO Mapping</span></p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td class=\"c44 c59\">\n                        <p class=\"c53 c60 c101\"><span class=\"c15 c3\">Weight</span></p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                <!-- Loop through each assessment -->\n                <tr>\n                    <td class=\"c57\">\n                        <p class=\"c46\">\n                  <span class=\"c2\">Quiz 1</span>\n                        </p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td class=\"c47\">\n                        <p class=\"c35\">\n    <span class=\"c2\">\n      \n    </span>\n                        </p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td class=\"c44\">\n                        <p cl